'''The Depths''' is one of the levels in [[Chapter 3]]. It features a dark environment, filled with skulls. Common enemies in the Depths include Knights, Guts, and Vis.

The Depths' unlockable variants are {{s|Necropolis}} and the {{s|Dank Depths}}, which can be unlocked after defeating every boss from the Depths (not necessarily ''in'' the Depths), and after killing {{e|It Lives!}} 26 times.

The boss of The Depths II is always {{e|Mom}}.

{{dlc+|r}} After {{a|A Secret Exit}} is unlocked, a door will appear in Depths I's {{r|Boss Room}} upon defeating the boss, leading to the {{S|Mausoleum}} / {{S|Gehenna}}. This door requires two hearts to be opened (except on Lost characters). Unlike {{r|Angel Room}}s and {{r|Devil Room}}s, this door never disappears. Also after this achievement is unlocked, [[a Strange Door]] in the starting room of Depths II will appear. This door leads to {{S|Mausoleum}} / {{S|Gehenna}} II before entering the [[Ascent]].
